公父惠公朔之讒殺太子伋代立至於懿公，常欲敗之，卒滅惠公之後而更立黔牟之弟昭伯頑之子申爲君，是爲戴公。戴公申元年卒。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"懿公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001560","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"懿公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001560","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"惠公朔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001557","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"太子伋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001553","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"懿公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001560","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001557","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"黔牟","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001559","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0052","start":52,"end":55,"surface":"昭伯頑","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001561","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0057","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"申","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001562","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"戴公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001562","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0066","start":66,"end":69,"surface":"戴公申","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001562","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-037","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p020","text":"初，翟殺懿公也，衞人憐之，思復立宣公前死太子伋之後，伋子又死，而代伋死者子壽又無子。太子伋同母弟二人：其一曰黔牟，黔牟嘗代惠公爲君，八年復去；其二曰昭伯。昭伯、黔牟皆已前死，故立昭伯子申爲戴公。戴